#. module: kaitech_mcp_server
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:kaitech_mcp_server.field_mcp_token__field_restrictions
msgid ""
"JSON object mapping model names to allowed field lists. Example:\n"
"{\"sale.order\": [\"name\", \"partner_id\", \"amount_total\"],\n"
" \"res.partner\": [\"name\", \"email\"]}\n"
"\n"
"Omitting a model means all its fields are allowed. Applied to both read (silently drops disallowed fields) and write (raises error if disallowed field is written)."
msgstr ""
"Objek JSON yang memetakan nama model ke daftar field yang diizinkan. Contoh:\n"
"{\"sale.order\": [\"name\", \"partner_id\", \"amount_total\"],\n"
" \"res.partner\": [\"name\", \"email\"]}\n"
"\n"
"Jika model tidak dicantumkan, semua field-nya diizinkan. Berlaku untuk baca (field yang tidak diizinkan dibuang tanpa pemberitahuan) dan tulis (memunculkan error jika field yang tidak diizinkan ditulis)."

#. module: kaitech_mcp_server
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:kaitech_mcp_server.mcp_token_view_form
msgid ""
"JSON object: model name → list of allowed field names.\n"
"                                    For read operations, fields outside the list are silently dropped.\n"
"                                    For write operations, fields outside the list raise a permission error.\n"
"                                    Example: {\"sale.order\": [\"name\", \"partner_id\", \"amount_total\"]}"
msgstr ""
"Objek JSON: nama model → daftar nama field yang diizinkan.\n"
"                                    Untuk operasi baca, field di luar daftar dibuang tanpa pemberitahuan.\n"
"                                    Untuk operasi tulis, field di luar daftar memunculkan error izin.\n"
"                                    Contoh: {\"sale.order\": [\"name\", \"partner_id\", \"amount_total\"]}"

